      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} 你好，因为vrchat名下所有域名网站接入Cloudflare,导致直接连接vrchat.com均出现time out，而需确认问题是否解决，需要注册全新账号，但是，使用跨境代理注册账号均无法成功注册。于是寻找可信任的代理服务器消耗了许久时间。很高兴我终于找到了未在黑名单的代理服务器，并成功注册账号，但是在手机上始终处于加载中。\n\nHello,All domains under VRChat are currently routed through Cloudflare, causing direct connections to vrchat.com to time out. To verify whether the issue has been resolved, I attempted to register a new account. However, using cross-border proxies for registration repeatedly failed.After spending a considerable amount of time searching, I finally found a trusted proxy server that wasn’t blacklisted and successfully created an account. Unfortunately, the app remains stuck on a loading screen when accessed via mobile.\n\n(Translated by deepseek-v3)\n\nVersion:2025.1.3p4-1610-335993c8b1-Release",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
